{
 "id": 177565,
 "name": "Payment Support for the EU Digital Identity Wallet Community Group",
 "is_closed": false,
 "creation-date": "2026-06-10",
 "description": "<p>The mission for this group is to propose and if possible consolidate different aspects of payment authorizations using the EU Digital Identity Wallet.  This includes:</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>UX considerations</li>\n<li>Different flows like \"push-through\" and 3D Secure/Oauth2</li>\n<li>Electronic receipts</li>\n<li>Account balance reports</li>\n<li>Local payments</li>\n<li>Person-to-Person payments</li>\n<li>Possible innovation with respect to other systems</li>\n</ul>\n\nThis group may publish Specifications.",
